## Import

Import is supported using the following syntax:

{{codefile "shell" "examples/resources/morpheus_setting_backup/import.sh" }}

The settings are a singleton, so the import ID identifies nothing and any value works (for example
`1`). The id is `"1"` whatever ID you give.

## Upgrading from an earlier version

Earlier versions of the provider implemented this resource with the legacy plugin SDK. Existing state
is upgraded in place: an unset default storage bucket or schedule, which the previous version stored
as `0`, becomes null, and the retention is carried into both `retention_count` and `retention_days`.
The plan after upgrading is clean.
